Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?applet:=20zero-initialize=20all=20=5Fcleanup=5F?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20decorated=20locals=20(chip/notification/profile)=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20fixes=20post-error=20teardown=20segfault?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
