Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Repro: at_csim + card-error SW ending an ES10 exchange (mock --case-sensitive,
STORE DATA -> 6D00) -> es10c_get_eid error JSON printed -> SIGSEGV in
es10c_ex_euiccinfo2_free walking an uninitialized stack struct (free(0x3),
gdb: __GI_free <- es10c_ex_euiccinfo2_free <- applet_main chip/info).
Fix: initialize the 11 affected declarations across 8 applet files
(structs {0}, pointers NULL) so error-path cleanup walks zeros.
Verified x86: same wire flow now exits 255 with clean JSON, no crash.
---
 src/applet/chip/info.c            | 6 +++---
 src/applet/notification/dump.c    | 4 ++--
 src/applet/notification/list.c    | 2 +-
 src/applet/notification/process.c | 4 ++--
 src/applet/notification/remove.c  | 2 +-
 src/applet/notification/replay.c  | 2 +-
 src/applet/profile/list.c         | 2 +-
 7 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/applet/chip/info.c b/src/applet/chip/info.c
index bb27c43..c458dcf 100644
--- a/src/applet/chip/info.c
+++ b/src/applet/chip/info.c
@@ -14,9 +14,9 @@
 
